WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.269
The cook led Vinnie and Helene to the kitchen.

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.938
She put the rabbits on a long table.

3
00:00:07.939 --> 00:00:11.498
The kitchen was full of busy people.

4
00:00:11.499 --> 00:00:17.488
"You!" The cook pointed to Vinnie. "Start peeling!"

5
00:00:17.489 --> 00:00:20.811
Vinnie sat down at a pile of onions.

6
00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:23.880
Sighing, he began to peel them.

7
00:00:23.881 --> 00:00:27.991
Vinnie wondered what happened to Mandy.

8
00:00:27.992 --> 00:00:32.499
"I haven’t seen you here before," said a kitchen boy.

9
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.633
He grinned at Vinnie.

10
00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.210
"I’m new," said Vinnie.

11
00:00:37.211 --> 00:00:39.671
"Why is everyone so nervous?"

12
00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.291
"Our king is very picky.

13
00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:45.516
He likes his food cooked a certain way.

14
00:00:45.517 --> 00:00:52.407
If it isn’t"—the boy shuddered—"you’re in big trouble!"

15
00:00:52.408 --> 00:00:56.083
"What will he do?" Vinnie gulped.

16
00:00:56.084 --> 00:01:00.413
"You don’t want to know," said the boy.

17
00:01:00.414 --> 00:01:06.475
Meanwhile, Mandy was trying to find her way out of the palace.

18
00:01:06.476 --> 00:01:11.269
"I wish I knew where Helene was!" she cried.

19
00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.749
She walked down a dark flight of stairs.

20
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.639
"This part of the palace is very different," she thought.

21
00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.007
The rooms were small and shabby.

22
00:01:23.008 --> 00:01:25.471
Mandy knocked on a door.

23
00:01:25.472 --> 00:01:27.547
She poked her head in.

24
00:01:27.548 --> 00:01:30.143
"Hello?" she said.

25
00:01:30.144 --> 00:01:34.895
"Elise? Is that you?" someone called.

26
00:01:34.896 --> 00:01:36.678
Mandy walked in.

27
00:01:36.679 --> 00:01:39.881
She found a sick woman in a bed.

28
00:01:39.882 --> 00:01:42.266
The room was damp.

29
00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:46.581
"I’m looking for Helene," said Mandy.

30
00:01:46.582 --> 00:01:48.568
The woman coughed.

31
00:01:48.569 --> 00:01:54.334
"Helene? Simone’s daughter? She’s not here."

32
00:01:54.335 --> 00:01:57.608
Mandy felt very bad for the woman.

33
00:01:57.609 --> 00:02:01.475
"Can I bring you some tea?" she asked.

34
00:02:01.476 --> 00:02:03.548
She shook her head.

35
00:02:03.549 --> 00:02:08.076
"If His Highness knows I am sick, I will be thrown out.

36
00:02:08.077 --> 00:02:10.207
Please do not tell."

37
00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:14.284
Mandy promised she wouldn’t.

38
00:02:14.285 --> 00:02:19.471
"King Louis and his friends live in luxury," she thought.

39
00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.759
"But the servants do not.

40
00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:28.019
How do the rest of the French people live?" wondered Mandy.

41
00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:32.263
In the kitchen, Vinnie’s eyes were watering.

42
00:02:32.264 --> 00:02:35.196
The onions made his eyes sting.

43
00:02:35.197 --> 00:02:37.618
He stood up to wipe his eyes.

44
00:02:37.619 --> 00:02:40.950
Vinnie’s elbow hit a bowl of green leaves.

45
00:02:40.951 --> 00:02:44.678
The bowl tipped and spilled on the table.

46
00:02:44.679 --> 00:02:47.551
"Uh-oh," he said.

47
00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:51.062
"Be careful with that!" said the kitchen boy.

48
00:02:51.063 --> 00:02:54.144
He was heading into the next room.

49
00:02:54.145 --> 00:02:56.779
"It looks like parsley.

50
00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:01.335
But that bitter herb can make you sick if you eat too much."

51
00:03:01.336 --> 00:03:05.550
Vinnie scooped the bitter herb back into the bowl.

52
00:03:05.551 --> 00:03:09.110
The cook called out, "Give me that parsley!

53
00:03:09.111 --> 00:03:10.933
I need it for the soup!"

54
00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:13.412
Vinnie looked at him, puzzled.

55
00:03:13.413 --> 00:03:16.947
"What parsley?" he asked.

56
00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:21.354
"In your hand!" the cook yelled.

57
00:03:21.355 --> 00:03:24.670
"But this isn’t—," Vinnie began.

58
00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:27.005
The cook grabbed the bowl.

59
00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:30.525
"Get back to the onions!" he screamed.

60
00:03:30.526 --> 00:03:34.600
Then he poured the bitter herb into the soup.

61
00:03:34.601 --> 00:03:37.203
Vinnie’s eyes grew big.

62
00:03:37.204 --> 00:03:39.746
"But, sir," he began.

63
00:03:39.747 --> 00:03:41.603
It was too late.

64
00:03:41.604 --> 00:03:44.402
The cook put the soup on a tray.

65
00:03:44.403 --> 00:03:49.143
"This is the king’s favorite," the cook said to a servant.

66
00:03:49.144 --> 00:03:55.443
"Take it to him at once."

